@startuml
title M1.2 Implemented — Repository Model and Explainable Impact
actor Engineer
participant "Repository Intelligence" as RI
participant "Read-only Analyzers" as Analyzer
database "XDG CACHE\nRepositoryModel" as Cache
participant "Impact Engine" as Impact
database "XDG DATA\nChange Artifact Authority" as Authority

Engineer -> RI: request model for Project
RI -> RI: inspect source fingerprint before build
RI -> Cache: load exact build key if present
alt reusable complete entry
  Cache --> RI: file-local analyzer results
else missing, corrupt, stale, or incompatible
  RI -> Analyzer: read bounded repository inputs
  Analyzer --> RI: observed/derived/inferred assertions + gaps
end
RI -> RI: recompute global graph and gaps
RI -> RI: inspect source fingerprint after build
RI -> Cache: replace derived cache only after exact proof
Engineer -> Impact: analyze ChangeIntent + exact RepositoryModel
Impact -> Impact: bounded relation-specific traversal
Impact -> Impact: classify impact and advisory RiskProfile
Impact -> Authority: append immutable Change-owned ImpactReport
Authority --> Engineer: exact ArtifactId and freshness inputs
note over Impact,Authority
Impact never expands ApprovedScope.
STALE or UNKNOWN input cannot drive current use.
end note
@enduml
